            "detailed_description": "<strong>Notice: Requires a Virtual Reality headset and a Gamepad!</strong><br><br><strong>Poker Show VR</strong> is an entertaining VR poker game featuring classic five card draw poker meets real-life fashion models as opponents, who tastefully remove clothing when they lose.<br>The game focuses on real-life experience, and features a dynamic mix of pre-shot panoramic videos of beautiful models and interactive content.<br><br>Poker Show VR is the first poker game which gives you the illusion of reality.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic five card draw poker game<br></li><li> 3 real-life fashion models as opponents<br></li><li> Achievement system – 18 achievements<br></li><li> Leaderboards<br></li><li> Social Experience – selfies and text messages from opponents after you beat them</li></ul>",
